682,"toc":688},[683],[200,684,685],{},[310,686,359],{"href":687},"/downloads/stories/4-Voidspire-Job.pdf",{"title":321,"searchDepth":322,"depth":322,"links":689},[],"2022-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","Downloadable PDF story.",{"slug":693},"the-voidspire-job","/resources/the-voidspire-job",{"title":680,"description":691},"resources/the-voidspire-job",[20,698,373,374],"The Voidspire Job","_vcIJqS7O69KIhLMyB_2-E7M7BQFBjq8pHK6cP5oxgo",[701,814,911],{"id":702,"title":24,"available":185,"body":703,"coverImage":325,"currency":326,"date":797,"description":798,"extension":329,"featured":185,"image":799,"manualUrl":325,"meta":800,"navigation":185,"path":25,"playTime":325,"playerCount":325,"price":801,"published":185,"releaseDate":325,"resources":802,"seo":807,"slug":707,"stem":808,"tags":809,"thumbnail":325,"__hash__":813},"games/games/blood-neon.md",{"type":187,"value":704,"toc":794},[705,708,712,715,717,739,747,754,760,762,768,774,777,780,782,788],[190,706,24],{"id":707},"blood-neon",[195,709,711],{"id":710},"a-hyperviolent-vaporwave-nightmare-ttrpg-for-3-6-fighters","A hyperviolent vaporwave nightmare ttrpg for 3-6 fighters!",[200,713,714],{},"Show no mercy because you will be shown none. Bash and shred your way to glory, and become the one thing the fearless fear. The 11th Realm’s elected monarch has reached into another dimension for profit, creating a golden age of consumerism in the material world. That greed has cost the 11th Realm dearly. Now monsters from a plane only known as the Neon tear through into our reality and wreak havoc on the citizens of the land. The only thing standing between us and annihilation are heroes like you, Neon Hunters who become living weapons. Devastate the enemy, die, and die again, and ascend to new heights of power.",[239,716],{},[200,718,719,720,723,724,727,728,731,732,735,736],{},"Featuring ",[203,721,722],{},"badass artwork"," by Luis Melo",[203,725,726],{},", Blood Neon"," is hyperviolent vaporwave fantasy on the tabletop. The ",[203,729,730],{},"NEON system"," let's you get right into the thick of it with ",[203,733,734],{},"fast-paced combat"," that let's the GM throw hordes of monsters at you without the brain burn. Build your own Star from a variety of classes, skills, and equipment and ",[203,737,738],{},"team up with your friends to fight back the neon horde!",[200,740,741,222,743],{},[239,742],{},[231,744],{"alt":745,"src":746},"BloodNeon_Infuser_V04_Delivery_Prev.jpg","https://tools.drivethrurpg.com/images/16893/_product_images/538529/BloodNeon_Infuser_V04_Delivery_Prev.jpg",[200,748,749,750,753],{},"The ",[203,751,752],{},"NEON System","  - adds strategic depth while reducing brain burn by providing the GM with pre-programmed enemy behavior.",[200,755,756,759],{},[203,757,758],{},"Momentum & Ascension"," - Demands aggressive and engaging combat. Players absorb energy from defeated enemies to replenish their health or spend it to increase the size of their damage die.",[239,761],{},[200,763,764,767],{},[203,765,766],{},"Fight, Die, and Die Again -"," When a character falls in combat, they are returned to life by the Neon Infusers and jump back into the fray! But beware, too many infusions and characters start to lose their skills, or their very identity, until their is nothing left but a unthinking killing machine.",[200,769,770,773],{},[203,771,772],{},"Connections"," - A flexible skill system gives players the flexibility to flesh out their character's backgrounds and relationships. Want to be a hunter? A blacksmith? Magician? Jester? Want to be married to the Duke? Have a sister who's a renowned thief? The choice is yours. ",[200,775,776],{},"Two to five players can run one-shots or campaigns with everything in the rulebook. Each copy of Blood Neon also comes with 3 sheets of printable stars and monsters, character sheets for each class, an adventure for new characters, and tips to make your own encounters.",[200,778,779],{},"Blood Neon was written and designed by Adam Blumenau and R. Val, art by Luis Melo",[239,781],{},[200,783,784],{},[310,785,786],{"href":786,"rel":787},"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/538529/blood-neon",[314],[200,789,790],{},[231,791],{"alt":792,"src":793},"hiphopbard_charsheet.jpg","https://tools.drivethrurpg.com/images/16893/_product_images/538529/hiphopbard_charsheet.jpg",{"title":321,"searchDepth":322,"depth":322,"links":795},[796],{"id":710,"depth":322,"text":711},"2024-03-15T00:00:00.000Z","Cyberpunk adventure in the neon-lit streets of Neo-Tokyo.","/images/blood-neon/cover/blood-neon-cover.jpg",{},24.99,[803,805],{"title":804,"url":67},"Faction Guide",{"title":806,"url":67},"GM Screen",{"title":24,"description":798},"games/blood-neon",[343,810,811,812],"cyberpunk","adventure","cooperative","LIn7NJpDVTH1ZnLm7OnNbkybcZb7FXG5ueFanLLYLRw",{"id":184,"title":20,"available":185,"body":815,"coverImage":325,"currency":326,"date":327,"description":328,"extension":329,"featured":185,"image":330,"manualUrl":57,"meta":905,"navigation":185,"path":21,"playTime":325,"playerCount":325,"price":332,"published":185,"releaseDate":325,"resources":906,"seo":909,"slug":340,"stem":341,"tags":910,"thumbnail":325,"__hash__":347},{"type":187,"value":816,"toc":902},[817,819,821,825,829,833,841,845,847,849,855,861,867,869,879,881,885,887,889,893,898],[190,818,193],{"id":192},[195,820,198],{"id":197},[200,822,823],{},[203,824,205],{},[200,826,827],{},[203,828,210],{},[200,830,831,216],{},[203,832,215],{},[200,834,835,222,837],{},[203,836,221],{},[224,838,839],{},[203,840,20],{},[200,842,843],{},[231,844],{"alt":233,"src":234},[200,846,237],{},[239,848],{},[200,850,851,245,853,249],{},[224,852,20],{},[203,854,248],{},[200,856,857,222,859],{},[239,858],{},[231,860],{"alt":233,"src":256},[200,862,259,863,263,865,267],{},[203,864,262],{},[203,866,266],{},[239,868],{},[200,870,272,871,275,873,279,875,283,877,287],{},[224,872,20],{},[203,874,278],{},[203,876,282],{},[203,878,286],{},[239,880],{},[200,882,292,883,295],{},[224,884,20],{},[200,886,298],{},[239,888],{},[200,890,303,891,306],{},[224,892,20],{},[200,894,895],{},[310,896,312],{"href":312,"rel":897},[314],[200,899,900],{},[231,901],{"alt":233,"src":319},{"title":321,"searchDepth":322,"depth":322,"links":903},[904],{"id":197,"depth":322,"text":198},{},[907,908],{"title":335,"url":336},{"title":338,"url":67},{"title":20,"description":328},[343,344,345,346],{"id":912,"title":913,"available":185,"body":914,"coverImage":325,"currency":326,"date":1069,"description":1070,"extension":329,"featured":364,"image":1071,"manualUrl":53,"meta":1072,"navigation":185,"path":1073,"playTime":325,"playerCount":325,"price":1074,"published":185,"releaseDate":325,"resources":1075,"seo":1078,"slug":1079,"stem":1080,"tags":1081,"thumbnail":325,"__hash__":1086},"games/games/get-in-loser-we-re-going-to-steal-the-kilogram.md","Get in Loser, We're Going to Steal the Kilogram",{"type":187,"value":915,"toc":1066},[916,919,925,933,940,942,949,951,958,960,966,968,975,977,980,982,989,991,993,995,998,1000,1003,1005,1012,1014,1021,1023,1030,1032,1035,1037,1042,1044,1047,1049,1052,1054,1057,1063],[190,917,913],{"id":918},"get-in-loser-were-going-to-steal-the-kilogram",[200,920,921],{},[231,922],{"alt":923,"src":924},"v2LeUW.png","/bafkreiahgxziaisasw5ec2xoi27d2mk5k5s2ye3fk7rjr4vkwpwngumtsi.jpg",[195,926,928],{"id":927},"an-action-packed-heist-for-all-ages",[224,929,930],{},[203,931,932],{},"An action-packed heist for all ages!",[200,934,935],{},[224,936,937],{},[203,938,939],{},"The year is 2017.",[239,941],{},[200,943,944,216],{},[224,945,946],{},[203,947,948],{},"The model kilogram is a year away from retirement.",[239,950],{},[200,952,953],{},[224,954,955],{},[203,956,957],{},"Now is your time!",[239,959],{},[200,961,962,965],{},[224,963,964],{},"Get In Loser, We're Stealing the Kilogram"," takes place during the World Middle School Science Fair, with the eponymous model kilogram as its centerpiece. This game tells two stories: ",[239,967],{},[200,969,970,971,974],{},"The dashing ",[203,972,973],{},"Illustrious Aces",", a heist crew preparing for their final big score, but there's a hitch. Your wheelman ghosted you the day of the job. You have the training, but you'll have to make do with gadgets scrounged from the middle school science fair. ",[239,976],{},[200,978,979],{},"OR",[239,981],{},[200,983,984,985,988],{},"The plucky ",[203,986,987],{},"Grape Juice Gang",", a well-bonded set of middle schoolers who just found a bag of spy gear. Summer break is coming up, and wouldn't nabbing that cool kilogram be a great way to send yourselves off?",[239,990],{},[200,992,979],{},[239,994],{},[200,996,997],{},"Play the two teams against each other in an epic and wacky adventure. ",[239,999],{},[200,1001,1002],{},"But be careful! ",[239,1004],{},[200,1006,1007,1008,1011],{},"Whichever run you choose, ",[203,1009,1010],{},"Junior Detective Jenny Venetti"," is on the case, and she's hot on your trail!",[239,1013],{},[200,1015,1016],{},[224,1017,1018],{},[203,1019,1020],{},"Two Teams,",[239,1022],{},[200,1024,1025,216],{},[224,1026,1027],{},[203,1028,1029],{},"One Prize.",[239,1031],{},[200,1033,1034],{},"Can you nab the kilogram and get out before Detective Jenny and the authorities close in? ",[239,1036],{},[200,1038,1039,1041],{},[224,1040,964],{}," is a oneshot heist ttrpg designed to be played in one of 3 possible runs, as described above. The dice mechanic is simple but intuitive. You want to hit the center of your dice's range (so a 5 and a 6 on a d10). The GJG gets more dice to represent their chaos, but the IA gets better but less dice to represent the focus of their training. Skills and gear vary thematically between the overgeared adolescents and the improvising professionals.",[239,1043],{},[200,1045,1046],{},"Build a heister quickly, and run the entire thing in a couple of hours! Great for parties!",[239,1048],{},[200,1050,1051],{},"Your purchase includes the A5 sized singles and spreads for the document at print quality. 8 Pages, in color. ",[239,1053],{},[200,1055,1056],{},"A collaboration between Shrike Publishing and Rathayibacter. ",[200,1058,1059],{},[310,1060,1061],{"href":1061,"rel":1062},"https://shrikepublishing.itch.io/get-in-loser-were-stealing-the-kilogram",[314],[1064,1065],"hr",{},{"title":321,"searchDepth":322,"depth":322,"links":1067},[1068],{"id":927,"depth":322,"text":932},"2024-11-10T00:00:00.000Z","A chaotic heist game about stealing the international prototype kilogram from a climate-controlled vault in Paris. For 2-5 players who believe measurement should belong to everyone.","/ShrikeLogoNov2021.png",{},"/games/get-in-loser-we-re-going-to-steal-the-kilogram",15,[1076],{"title":1077,"url":53},"Print & Play Version",{"title":913,"description":1070},"steal-the-kilogram","games/get-in-loser-we-re-going-to-steal-the-kilogram",[343,1082,1083,1084,1085],"heist","comedy","one-shot","print-and-play","YmcZelmPA1Sar_76QyK5iYefhC_x1SJph4AhH4SByog",1760842217906]